    "collapsible-content": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible-row-2": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Benefits of using Enamel Care Serum",
            "icon": "heart",
            "row_content": "<p>✓ Everyday Defence: Helps protect teeth from daily exposure to food and drink<br\/><br\/>✓ Smile Care: Supports the look and feel of a healthier smile as part of your daily routine<br\/><br\/>✓ Whitening Boost: Helps lift surface stains gently for a fresher-looking smile<br\/><br\/>✓ Daily Shield: Helps guard against the effects of grinding and acidic foods<br\/><br\/>✓ Surface Protection: Forms a protective layer to help minimise the effects of enamel wear<br\/><br\/>✓ Sensitivity Support: Enjoy hot and cold foods more comfortably with our soothing formula<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "List of ingredients",
            "icon": "leaf",
            "row_content": "<p>Xylitol, Aqua\/Water,Dicalcium Phosphate Dihydrate,Disodium Phosphate, Glycerin, Hydroxyapatite (Nano), Cellulose Gum, Mentha Piperita (Peppermint) Oil,Potassium Chloride, Phenoxyethanol,Xanthan Gum, Stevioside, Theobromine, Ethylhexylglycerin.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Instructions",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>1. Apply 2 pumps to your fingertip or toothbrush and apply onto your teeth.<\/p><p>2. Once applied, allow the serum to be absorbed by your teeth. <\/p><p>3. Typically there is no need to rinse as this is usually absorbed however if you notice any uncomfortable residue, feel free to spit or rinse. <\/p><p>4. Wait 30 minutes before eating or drinking.<\/p><p>The enamel care serum is recommended to be applied after brushing your teeth. <\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "dc156c5a-46c9-43e5-acbd-475340353fc0": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "When should I use HA5 Serum?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Enamel Care Serum is recommended to be used as a post brushing treatment, however it can also be used on its own.<\/p><p><strong>Recommended usage time<\/strong>: Daily - recommended before bedtime.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-0": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Cautions",
            "icon": "lightning_bolt",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>1. Storage<\/strong>: Store the product correctly,  typically in a cool, dry place, away from direct sunlight.<\/p><p><strong>2. Keep out of reach of children<\/strong>: Like all oral care products, Enamel Care Serum should be kept out of the reach of children to prevent accidental ingestion.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_fHTJzn": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can the Enamel Care Serum be used on composite bonding, veneers or fillings?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, the Enamel Care Serum is suitable for use on composite bonding, veneers, and fillings. The serum is formulated to be gentle on all dental materials while providing essential care to your natural enamel. It works to strengthen and protect your teeth, helping to maintain the health of both your natural teeth and any dental restorations you may have.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
